<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Global Intentional Homicide Trends: A Multi-Dimensional Analysis (1990–2023)</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --primary: #1f4e79;
    --accent: #c55a11;
    --success: #548235;
    --danger: #c23531;
    --bg: #f8f9fa;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --text: #333333;
    --muted: #666666;
    --border: #dee2e6;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { font-family: "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; }
  .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; }
  header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, #163a5c 100%); color: #fff; padding: 48px 24px; text-align: center; }
  header h1 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; }
  header p { margin: 0; font-size: 1.05rem; opacity: 0.9; }
  .meta { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 12px 0 24px; }
  .kpi-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin: 32px 0; }
  .kpi-card { background: var(--card); border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-top: 4px solid var(--primary); }
  .kpi-card.accent { border-top-color: var(--accent); }
  .kpi-card.danger { border-top-color: var(--danger); }
  .kpi-card.success { border-top-color: var(--success); }
  .kpi-value { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); margin: 8px 0; }
  .kpi-card.accent .kpi-value { color: var(--accent); }
  .kpi-card.danger .kpi-value { color: var(--danger); }
  .kpi-card.success .kpi-value { color: var(--success); }
  .kpi-label { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
  .kpi-context { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 6px; }
  section { background: var(--card); border-radius: 10px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
  h2 { color: var(--primary); margin-top: 0; font-size: 1.4rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 10px; }
  h3 { color: var(--primary); margin-top: 24px; font-size: 1.1rem; }
  p { margin: 12px 0; }
  .chart { text-align: center; margin: 20px 0; }
  .chart img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0; font-size: 0.92rem; }
  th, td { padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  th { background: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 600; color: var(--primary); }
  tr:hover { background: #f8fafc; }
  .tag { display: inline-block; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .tag-up { background: #fdecea; color: var(--danger); }
  .tag-down { background: #e8f5e9; color: var(--success); }
  .tag-neutral { background: #e3f2fd; color: var(--primary); }
